      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "dirname 用于获取某个目录或文件的上一层路径。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "bash",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "dirname /etc/hosts\n# 输出：/etc（文件 hosts 的上一层路径）\n\ndirname /usr/bin/\n# 输出：/usr（目录的上一层路径）\n\ndirname /etc\n# 输出：.（当前正处于该目录下，返回点号）"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "二、脚本中获取当前路径（经典写法）"
          }
